Changes in v2:
- Drop the questions section. The spec states the end state; the
  remaining questions are in the thread.
- Send with smtprelay instead of OpenSMTPD, so Fastmail's rejection
  reaches the client in its session.
- Allow only claude@p7x.dev as the envelope sender.
- Abandon the whole message when any recipient is rejected.
- Listen for SMTP on port 2525, not 25.
- mbsync pulls only new messages, so deleting mail on Fastmail loses
  nothing locally.
- Add the lab-claude clients: mbsync and notmuch to read, msmtp to
  send.
